The bundled skill grew from a single share/claude-skill.md into the directory
share/kanban-issues-karr-cli/ (SKILL.md + 7 references/*.md). That layout only
exists in this checkout.

The installed karr 0.601 still ships the old single file: its sharedir
/home/getty/perl5/lib/perl5/auto/share/dist/App-karr/ holds claude-skill.md and
nothing else. So `karr skill install` and `karr skill update` currently hand a
repository the OLD skill -- for the ~90 fleet repos that would be a downgrade,
and `karr skill check` reports "outdated" even against a checkout-current copy.

Until a release ships share/kanban-issues-karr-cli/, the only working
distribution path into the fleet is `manage-skills link kanban-issues-karr-cli`
from the karr checkout.

Done when a released App-karr installs the directory and `karr skill check` in
a fleet repo linked to this checkout answers current.

